<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><!--sx-ob--><style>html,body{overscroll-behavior:none}*{overscroll-behavior-x:none}[data-ob]{overscroll-behavior-y:none!important}</style><script>/* no bounce and no scroll chaining: a box that really overflows stops dead at its ends */(function(){function ob(e){for(var el=e.target;el&&el.nodeType===1;el=el.parentElement){var o=getComputedStyle(el).overflowY;if(o!=="auto"&&o!=="scroll")continue;var on=el.scrollHeight>el.clientHeight+2;if(on!==el.hasAttribute("data-ob")){if(on)el.setAttribute("data-ob","");else el.removeAttribute("data-ob");}}}["pointerover","wheel","touchstart"].forEach(function(t){addEventListener(t,ob,{capture:true,passive:true});});})();</script>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>krillion</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script>(function(){var R=document.documentElement;function s(){var t=null;try{t=parent.document.documentElement.getAttribute('data-theme')}catch(e){}
var d=t?t==='dark':!!(window.matchMedia&&matchMedia('(prefers-color-scheme: dark)').matches);R.setAttribute('data-theme',d?'dark':'light')}
s();try{new MutationObserver(s).observe(parent.document.documentElement,{attributes:true,attributeFilter:['data-theme']})}catch(e){}})();</script>
<style>
  :root { --green: #58cc02; --green-dark: #58a700; --green-hi: #61e002; --green-wash: #d7ffb8;
    --blue: #4b9af3; --blue-dark: #3c81db; --blue-hi: #63a8f6; --blue-wash: #e6f1ff; --blue-line: #a4ceff; --blue-text: #4b9af3;
    --red: #ff4b4b; --red-dark: #ea2b2b; --red-wash: #ffdfe0; --gold: #ffc800; --gold-dark: #e5a400; --gold-wash: #fff5d3;
    --orange: #ff9600; --orange-dark: #cd7900; --purple: #ce82ff; --purple-dark: #a568cc; --pink: #ff86d0; --pink-dark: #d65fae;
    --bg: #fff; --panel: #fff; --panel-soft: #f7f7f7; --line: #e5e5e5; --line-hi: #d0d0d0; --text: #4b4b4b; --text-dim: #777; --text-faint: #afafaf;
    --display: 'Fredoka', 'Nunito', system-ui, sans-serif; --sans: 'Nunito', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; color-scheme: light; }
  :root[data-theme="dark"] { --bg: #131f24; --panel: #131f24; --panel-soft: #202f36; --line: #37464f; --line-hi: #52656d; --text: #f1f7fb; --text-dim: #8799a3; --text-faint: #6f8691;
    --green-wash: #1c3a12; --blue-wash: #1c3150; --blue-line: #3c81db; --blue-text: #78b0fc; --red-wash: #3d1f22; --gold-wash: #3a3112; color-scheme: dark; }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  html, body { margin: 0; min-height: 100%; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font: 700 16px/1.5 var(--sans); -webkit-user-select: none; user-select: none;
    -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-x: hidden; }
  input { -webkit-user-select: text; user-select: text; }
  button, input { font: inherit; color: inherit; }
  svg { display: block; }
  [hidden] { display: none !important; }
  .top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; background: var(--bg); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line); position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 5; }
  .title { font: 700 28px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--blue-text); cursor: pointer; white-space: nowrap; outline: none; border-radius: 8px; }
  .title:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  .tright { display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: center; }
  .wrap { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 40px; }
  .lbl { font: 800 13px/1.3 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-faint); }
  .btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; min-height: 48px; padding: 0 20px;
    border: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 4px; border-radius: 12px; background: var(--bg); color: var(--blue-text);
    font: 800 15px/1.2 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .8px; text-transform: uppercase; cursor: pointer; touch-action: manipulation; outline: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .btn:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  .btn:active:not([disabled]) { transform: translateY(2px); border-bottom-width: 2px; margin-bottom: 2px; }
  .btn.acc, .btn.blu { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue-dark); color: #fff; }
  .btn.gold { background: var(--gold); border-color: var(--gold-dark); color: #6b4a00; }
  .btn.ghost { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .btn.sm { min-height: 36px; padding: 0 14px; font-size: 13px; border-radius: 10px; border-bottom-width: 3px; }
  .btn.sm:active:not([disabled]) { transform: translateY(1px); border-bottom-width: 2px; margin-bottom: 1px; }
  .btn.sq { flex: none; width: 40px; padding: 0; font-size: 17px; }
  .btn.sq svg { width: 20px; height: 20px; }
  .btn.wide { width: 100%; min-height: 54px; font-size: 16px; border-radius: 16px; }
  .btn[disabled] { cursor: default; background: var(--line); border-color: var(--line); color: var(--text-faint); }
  @media (hover: hover) { .btn:not([disabled]):hover { background: var(--panel-soft); } .btn.acc:not([disabled]):hover, .btn.blu:not([disabled]):hover { background: var(--blue-hi); }
    .btn.gold:not([disabled]):hover { background: #ffd333; } }
  .card { background: var(--panel); border: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 4px; border-radius: 16px; }
  button.card { display: block; width: 100%; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; font: inherit; color: inherit; outline: none; }
  button.card:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  @media (hover: hover) { button.card:hover { background: var(--panel-soft); } }
  button.card:active { transform: translateY(2px); border-bottom-width: 2px; margin-bottom: 2px; }

  /* home */
  .hero { border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; border: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 4px; }
  .hero svg { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .hhead { display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin: 20px 0 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hhead h1 { margin: 0; font: 700 34px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); }
  .daily { padding: 18px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 72px minmax(0, 1fr) auto; gap: 16px; align-items: center; }
  .daily .ic { width: 72px; height: 72px; }
  .daily h2, .mode h2 { margin: 0; font: 700 24px/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); }
  .daily .btn { min-width: 170px; }
  .sub { font: 800 14px/1.35 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .res { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 4px; }
  .res b { font: 700 26px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--blue-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .modes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .mode { padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; min-width: 0; }
  .mode .mh { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; min-width: 0; }
  .mode .ic { flex: none; width: 56px; height: 56px; }
  .mode .btn { margin-top: auto; }
  .stats { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .stat { padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; min-width: 0; }
  .stat .v { font: 700 26px/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .stat .v.g { color: var(--orange); }
  .crew { margin-top: 16px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
  .crew .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 10px; }
  .pal { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 10px 4px 8px; border: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 4px; border-radius: 14px;
    background: var(--bg); cursor: pointer; min-width: 0; outline: none; font: 800 12px/1.2 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); text-align: center; }
  .pal:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  .pal .pic { width: 48px; height: 48px; }
  .pal.on { border-color: var(--blue); background: var(--blue-wash); color: var(--blue-text); }
  .pal.lock { cursor: default; color: var(--text-faint); }
  .pal.lock .pic { filter: grayscale(1) brightness(.75); opacity: .35; }
  .pal span { overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  /* lists (archive, themes) */
  .shead { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 14px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .shead h1 { margin: 0; font: 700 32px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); }
  .rows { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .arow { padding: 12px 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .arow .l { display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 0; }
  .arow .l b { font: 700 20px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); }
  .arow .r { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex: none; }
  .arow .m { font: 700 18px/1 var(--display); color: var(--blue-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .themes { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 12px; }
  .theme { padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; }
  .theme .tt { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
  .theme .tt i { flex: none; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font: 700 22px/1 var(--display); color: #fff;
    border-bottom: 3px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); font-style: normal; }
  .theme b { font: 700 22px/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

  /* play */
  .play { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 84px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 16px; align-items: start; }
  .meter { position: sticky; top: 78px; height: min(560px, calc(100dvh - 110px)); border-radius: 16px; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    border: 2px solid var(--line); border-bottom-width: 4px; }
  .meter .band { flex: 1; position: relative; }
  .meter .band span { position: absolute; left: 6px; top: 4px; font: 800 11px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .04em; }
  .meter .mk { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; height: 0; transition: top 1.2s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.2,1); }
  .meter .mk i { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; top: -2px; height: 4px; background: var(--gold); }
  .meter .mk .pic { position: absolute; right: 6px; top: -17px; width: 34px; height: 34px; }
  .mcol { position: relative; min-width: 0; }
  .phead { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .depth { font: 700 30px/1.1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .depth small { font: 800 13px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .02em; color: var(--text-faint); margin-left: 6px; }
  .dots { display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .dots i { width: 26px; height: 12px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--line); }
  .dots i.cur { background: var(--blue); }
  .t0b { background: var(--red) !important; } .t1b { background: #9aa5ab !important; } .t2b { background: var(--pink) !important; } .t3b { background: var(--green) !important; }
  .t4b { background: var(--purple) !important; } .t5b { background: var(--orange) !important; } .t6b { background: var(--gold) !important; }
  .stage { border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 20px 18px; min-height: 220px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: background-color .9s ease;
    border-bottom: 4px solid rgba(0,0,0,.18); position: relative; overflow: hidden; }
  .stage .lbl { color: inherit; opacity: .8; position: relative; }
  .stage .q { font: 700 clamp(26px, 5.4vw, 40px)/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; flex: 1; display: flex; align-items: center; position: relative; }
  .stage .bub { position: absolute; bottom: -20px; border-radius: 50%; background: rgba(255,255,255,.35); animation: rise 2.6s ease-in forwards; pointer-events: none; }
  @keyframes rise { to { transform: translateY(-320px); opacity: 0; } }
  .stage.pv .q { animation: fadein .6s ease both; }
  @keyframes fadein { from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(14px); } }
  .tbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; position: relative; min-height: 22px; }
  .tbar .tr { flex: 1; height: 16px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(0,0,0,.22); overflow: hidden; }
  .tbar .tr i { display: block; height: 100%; border-radius: 999px; background: #fff; width: 100%; }
  .tbar .tr i.lo { background: var(--gold); } .tbar .tr i.cr { background: var(--red); }
  .tbar b { font: 800 16px/1 var(--sans); min-width: 34px; text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tbar .pvt { font: 800 15px/1.2 var(--sans); }
  .tbar .pvt b { font: 700 22px/1 var(--display); margin-left: 6px; }
  .ans { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 14px; }
  .field { flex: 1; min-width: 0; min-height: 54px; padding: 10px 16px; border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; background: var(--panel-soft); color: var(--text);
    font: 800 19px/1.3 var(--sans); outline: none; }
  .field:focus { border-color: var(--blue); background: var(--bg); }
  .field::placeholder { color: var(--text-faint); }
  .field.bad { border-color: var(--red); background: var(--red-wash); }
  .shake { animation: shake .3s; }
  @keyframes shake { 25% { transform: translateX(-6px); } 50% { transform: translateX(6px); } 75% { transform: translateX(-3px); } }
  .ans .btn { min-height: 54px; }
  .msg { min-height: 22px; margin-top: 8px; font: 800 14px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--red); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .msg.ok { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .hint { margin-top: 4px; font: 800 13px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--text-faint); }
  .result { margin-top: 14px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; }
  .result .top2 { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .result .an { font: 700 30px/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; }
  .result .an.none { color: var(--text-faint); }
  .result .pts { font: 700 30px/1 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--blue-text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; white-space: nowrap; }
  .result .pts small { font: 800 14px/1 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); margin-left: 6px; letter-spacing: 0; }
  .result .bl { font: 800 15px/1.4 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); margin-top: -6px; }
  .result.gem { border-color: var(--gold-dark); background: var(--gold-wash); }
  .pill { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; min-height: 28px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 999px; font: 800 12px/1.2 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .06em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; border-bottom: 3px solid rgba(0,0,0,.2); white-space: nowrap; }
  .pill.t0 { background: var(--red); } .pill.t1 { background: #9aa5ab; } .pill.t2 { background: var(--pink); } .pill.t3 { background: var(--green); }
  .pill.t4 { background: var(--purple); } .pill.t5 { background: var(--orange); } .pill.t6 { background: var(--gold); color: #6b4a00; }
  .rare { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 14px; align-items: center; font: 800 15px/1.35 var(--sans); color: var(--text); }
  .rare span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .dot { width: 10px; height: 10px; border-radius: 50%; flex: none; display: inline-block; }
  .dot.t1 { background: #9aa5ab; } .dot.t2 { background: var(--pink); } .dot.t3 { background: var(--green); }
  .dot.t4 { background: var(--purple); } .dot.t5 { background: var(--orange); } .dot.t6 { background: var(--gold); }
  .acts { display: flex; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .acts .btn { flex: 1 1 auto; }
  .rbtns { display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .rbtns .btn.acc { flex: 1 1 200px; }

  /* sonar: where each tier would have taken you */
  .sonar { position: relative; height: 230px; border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden; }
  .sonar .sl { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; height: 0; border-top: 2px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.35); }
  .sonar .sl span { position: absolute; left: 10px; top: -11px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font: 800 12px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .04em;
    text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff; background: rgba(0,0,0,.28); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap; }
  .sonar .sl em { position: absolute; right: 10px; top: -10px; font: 800 12px/1 var(--sans); font-style: normal; color: rgba(255,255,255,.8); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .sonar .sl.me { border-top: 3px solid var(--gold); }
  .sonar .sl.me span { background: var(--gold); color: #6b4a00; }
  .sonar .sm { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 44px; height: 44px; margin: -22px 0 0 -22px; top: -12%; transition: top 1.3s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.2,1); }
  .sonar .sm .pic { width: 44px; height: 44px; }
  .sonar.miss .sm { animation: bob 1.6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  @keyframes bob { 50% { transform: translateY(-6px); } }

  /* end */
  .sum { border-radius: 16px; padding: 22px 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; border-bottom: 4px solid rgba(0,0,0,.18); }
  .sum .huge { font: 700 clamp(48px, 13vw, 84px)/1.05 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .sum .zn { font: 700 24px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .sum .vd { font: 800 16px/1.4 var(--sans); opacity: .9; }
  .sum .lbl { color: inherit; opacity: .8; }
  .sum .row3 { display: flex; gap: 10px 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 6px; font: 800 15px/1.3 var(--sans); }
  .log { margin-top: 16px; padding: 16px; }
  .log .lh { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .chart { position: relative; height: 200px; margin: 0 0 22px 0; border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden; }
  .chart .cols { position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 64px; display: grid; }
  .chart .col { position: relative; }
  .chart .col .stem { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 2px; margin-left: -1px; top: 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,.35); }
  .chart .col .bd { position: absolute; left: 50%; width: 22px; height: 22px; margin: -11px 0 0 -11px; border-radius: 50%; border: 3px solid #fff; animation: sink .8s cubic-bezier(.3,.7,.2,1) backwards; }
  @keyframes sink { from { transform: translateY(-40px); } }
  .chart .gl { position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; border-top: 1px dashed rgba(255,255,255,.25); }
  .chart .gl span { position: absolute; right: 6px; top: 2px; font: 800 10px/1 var(--sans); color: rgba(255,255,255,.7); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .cnum { display: grid; font: 800 12px/1 var(--sans); color: var(--text-faint); text-align: center; margin-top: -14px; padding-right: 64px; }
  .list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .it { padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; min-width: 0; }
  .it .q { font: 700 20px/1.2 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .it .me { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap; font: 800 16px/1.3 var(--sans); color: var(--text); }
  .it .p { flex: none; color: var(--blue-text); font: 700 20px/1.2 var(--display); white-space: nowrap; }
  .it .qh { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .it .qh .q { min-width: 0; }
  .it .rare { font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-dim); }
  .it .more { font: 800 13px/1.2 var(--sans); color: var(--blue-text); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  /* free dive */
  .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .chip { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg);
    font: 800 14px/1.2 var(--sans); color: var(--text); max-width: 100%; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .chip small { color: var(--text-dim); font-weight: 800; }

  /* modal */
  .modal { position: fixed; inset: 0; background: rgba(0,0,0,.45); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 16px; z-index: 20; }
  .modal .box { width: min(460px, 100%); max-height: calc(100dvh - 32px); overflow-y: auto; padding: 20px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; background: var(--bg); }
  .modal .box.big { width: min(620px, 100%); }
  .modal h3 { margin: 0; font: 700 26px/1.15 var(--display); letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--text); overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .modal p { margin: 0; font: 700 16px/1.45 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); }
  .tiers { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .tiers > div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .tiers .bl { font: 800 13px/1.35 var(--sans); color: var(--text-dim); }
  .tiers b { font: 700 18px/1 var(--display); color: var(--text); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .tabs { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; }
  .tab { min-height: 32px; padding: 0 10px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--line); background: var(--bg); cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;
    font: 800 12px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-dim); outline: none; }
  .tab:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  .tab.on { border-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue-text); background: var(--blue-wash); }
  .alist { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; max-height: min(52dvh, 460px); overflow-y: auto; border: 2px solid var(--line); border-radius: 12px; padding: 6px; }
  .alist div { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; padding: 6px 8px; border-radius: 8px; font: 800 15px/1.3 var(--sans); color: var(--text); min-width: 0; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  .alist div.mine { background: var(--blue-wash); }
  .alist div.gm { background: var(--gold-wash); }
  .alist .nt { color: var(--text-faint); font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 8px; }
  .setrow { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
  .tog { width: 56px; height: 32px; border-radius: 999px; border: 2px solid var(--line-hi); background: var(--line); position: relative; cursor: pointer; flex: none; outline: none; }
  .tog:focus-visible { box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--blue-line); }
  .tog::after { content: ''; position: absolute; top: 2px; left: 2px; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; background: #fff; transition: left .15s; }
  .tog.on { background: var(--blue); border-color: var(--blue-dark); }
  .tog.on::after { left: 26px; }
  .toast { position: fixed; left: 50%; bottom: 24px; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--text); color: var(--bg); padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 999px;
    font: 800 14px/1.3 var(--sans); z-index: 30; max-width: calc(100% - 32px); text-align: center; }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .meter .mk, .sonar .sm { transition: none; } .stage .bub, .chart .col .bd, .stage.pv .q { animation: none; } }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .modes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .daily { grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr); }
    .daily .ic { width: 56px; height: 56px; }
    .daily .btn { grid-column: 1 / -1; width: 100%; }
    .themes { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .crew .row { gap: 6px; }
    .pal .pic { width: 40px; height: 40px; }
    .pal { font-size: 11px; }
    .play { grid-template-columns: 52px minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; }
    .meter .band span { left: 3px; font-size: 10px; }
    .meter .mk .pic { right: 2px; width: 28px; height: 28px; top: -14px; }
    .stage { padding: 18px 16px 14px; min-height: 200px; }
    .dots { gap: 4px; } .dots i { width: 14px; height: 10px; }
    .depth { font-size: 24px; }
    .ans .btn { padding: 0 14px; }
    .hhead h1, .shead h1 { font-size: 28px; }
    .title { font-size: 24px; }
    .result .an { font-size: 26px; }
    .sonar .sl em { display: none; }
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="top"><div class="title" id="title" title="Games" role="button" tabindex="0">krillion</div><div class="tright"><button class="btn sm ghost" id="bHome" type="button" hidden>Home</button><button class="btn sm ghost sq" id="bSound" type="button" aria-label="Sound"></button><button class="btn sm ghost sq" id="bHelp" type="button" aria-label="How to play">?</button></div></div>
<div id="app"></div>
<div class="modal" id="help" hidden><div class="box card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="helpT">
  <h3 id="helpT">How to play</h3>
  <p>Each prompt has hundreds of right answers. Type one before the clock runs out. A wrong answer costs nothing, so keep trying.</p>
  <p>Obvious answers float near the surface. Rare ones sink you deeper: every point takes you 10&nbsp;m down, and a perfect dive of 700 points reaches the trench at 7,000&nbsp;m.</p>
  <div class="tiers" id="tierList"></div>
  <p>Every prompt hides one gem, the One in a Krillion. Watch out for Too Clever picks: they feel obscure, but everyone thinks of them.</p>
  <p>The Daily Dive is the same 7 prompts for everyone, once a day. Endless Dive serves fresh dives back to back, Free Dive gives you 60 seconds to name as many answers as you can, and the Archive replays past days.</p>
  <button class="btn acc wide" id="bHelpX" type="button">Got it</button>
</div></div>
<div class="modal" id="answers" hidden><div class="box card big" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="ansT">
  <h3 id="ansT"></h3>
  <div class="sub" id="ansN"></div>
  <div class="tabs" id="ansTabs"></div>
  <input class="field" id="ansQ" placeholder="Search answers" autocomplete="off" autocapitalize="off" spellcheck="false">
  <div class="alist" id="ansL"></div>
  <button class="btn acc wide" id="bAnsX" type="button">Close</button>
</div></div>
